 "notes": [
  "Every figure here is from the Chief Electoral Officer, Mizoram's press notes of 4 July 2026 on the draft and 7 September 2026 on the final roll. The district table of the draft and the reasons are in the Mizo version of the July note only.",
  "The roll before the revision is the 8,75,068 electors given enumeration forms, the roll as on 30 May 2026.",
  "The five reasons in the July note add to 46,163, one more than the roll before less the draft. The September note gives 46,162, which is the figure used here, and the reasons are kept as printed.",
  "Untraceable (8,333), shifted (13,978) and others (309) are counted together here, beside 21,295 dead and 2,248 already enrolled elsewhere.",
  "The figures leave out service electors, who are counted separately. There were 4,185 on the draft and 4,103 on the final roll.",
  "The constituency with the most forms not collected was 19 Aizawl South II, with 2,351, or 8.23 per cent of its roll.",
  "Kolasib, Lunglei and Khawzawl ended with fewer electors on the final roll than on the draft."
 ],
